The legal text comes from the official consolidated legislation of the Ministry of Justice and Courts Administration of Samoa (https://mjca.gov.ws/legislation/legislation.html), retrieved on 29 and 30 October and 27 November 2026: the Constitution of the Independent State of Samoa 1960 and 74 consolidated Acts and Ordinances, each the official version as at 31 December 2024 (data/versions.json lists each with its PDF). The Ministry states no licence for the legal texts. They are official legal texts; their copyright status is not confirmed here, and they are reproduced with the attribution above.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line; spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; running heads and page numbers were removed; and the text was arranged as git commits. The wording of the law was not changed. The Ministry of Justice and Courts Administration of Samoa does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Acts passed in 2025-26 come from the Parliament of Samoa (https://palemene.ws/bills-acts-and-regulations/), retrieved on 27 November 2026. The Parliament states no licence for them; they are official legal texts, reproduced with this attribution and without change to their wording.
